	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Petrum illum cum literis tuis magno adhuc desiderio expecto, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quandoquidem tabellarius vester illum heri non potuit assequi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Nunc non habeo, quod scribam, nisi pauca ad proximas <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>tuas.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Fratri meo nihil tale, quale istic sparsum est, accidit; <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quem etiam spero cum collegis suis me propediem hic salutaturum; <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>cupit enim senatus, ut adsint in commune cum cęteris in caussa <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ista plusquam seria et gravi consulturi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Librum suum si <persName>Leonardus</persName> noster nondum accepit, brevi, nihil <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>dubito, recepturus est; delituit apud homines, qui <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>hunc non absque magno fructu suo et aliorum legerunt.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Tu, quod ad hanc rem adtinet, ocioso animo esto; <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nec enim quicquam hic fraudis admissum est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/><persName ref="p8417">Musculum</persName> tantopere tibi probari vehementer me <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>exhilarat; dignus plane vir est, quem et boni et docti <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>omnes ob singulares domini dotes insigniter in eo <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>relucentes venerentur et ament.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Uxorem illius <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>hic cum liberis expectabimus officium facturi tantisper, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>dum ab ipso, quo se conferre debeant, certiores reddantur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Curabo, quamprimum, ubi venerint, resciscas, quando ita cupis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Quid in <placeName ref="l832">Galiis</placeName> 5 martyribus dei beneficio contigerit <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>(si dum vera sunt, quę <persName ref="p6469">Schnepffius</persName> serio ad me <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>scripsit), si non proxime ad te scripsi, ex <persName ref="p8498">Marcello <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Theodoricho</persName> intelliges.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Dedit ad nos <persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName> longum scriptum, quod super <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>indecreto isto C[aesaris] senatui <placeName ref="l491">Argentoraten[si]</placeName> oblatum est <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>a verbi ministris.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Scribit inter spem et metum illic omnia fluctuare<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Vgl. Titus Livius, Ab urbe condita, 42, 59, 8; Sueton, Claudius, 4, 4.</note>, sed <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>tamen spem nonnihil praevalere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/><placeName ref="l558">Wittenbergensis</placeName> schola pie et mascule super Interim <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>electori suo respondit, ut sperent principem recipere illud <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>haud quaquam posse propter priores suas spendidas pro<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>missiones.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ego supra modum mirabor, si non semel <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>mox corruet, quod tanta violentia et festinatione <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>tam invitis ubique obtruditur.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Puto vero hic si <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>usquam alibi locum habiturum proverbium: Quod cito fit, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>cito perit; <foreign xml:lang="de">bald gwunnen, bald zerrunnen.</foreign></s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>non poterit benignissimus servator diutius dissimulare filiorum <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>suorum suspiria et anxia vota in extremis istis periculis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p8426">Paulum illum Rasdorferum</persName> non uno solum nomine miserum <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>quam possum tibi diligenter commendo, ut illi apud vestros, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>aut ubiubi licebit, prospicias, ne, ubi venerit, sumptus <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>facere maiores quam pro re sua cogatur.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Miseret me <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>boni viri valde, quod nulla sit commoditate instructus <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>ad exilium facilius ferendum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Valetudine est imbecilli, <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>deinde multis oneratus liberis et nulla prorsus fortuna, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>ut de grandiore et ad magnos labores inapposita <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>ętate illius pariter et aliis nonnullis nihil dicam.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z10"/>igitur charitatis visceribus arctius nobis complectendus, <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>quibus adhuc, unde iuvemus alios, nonnihil adhuc suppetit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z12"/>Christus te, mi venerande et charissime frater, cum omnibus tuis <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>diligat et conservet.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Quem ora pro nobis indefatigabili <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>studio, ut aliquando ex malis istis liberati dominum in ecclesia <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>sanctorum suorum magnifice laudemus.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">19. Iulii 1548<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/>Der burgermaister von <placeName ref="l291">Lyndauw</placeName>, haist <persName>Lux von <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>Kirchen</persName>, ist mitt den seinen ausß <placeName ref="l291">Lyndauw</placeName> hinweg <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>gewichen, dessgleychen die edlen frauwen all, so in <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>dem freyen closter zuͦ <placeName ref="l291">Lyndauw</placeName> gewesen, sind ouch <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>davon, habend des verderbens nitt erwarten wellen.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z22"/>Gott well, da sy nymmermehr hinin kommind.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z23"/>Dero von <placeName ref="l291">Lyndauw</placeName> letste bottschafft ist ouch widerkommen, <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>und hat inen der k[aiser] noch 12 tag zyl geben, das sy sich <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>ains anderen letstlich bedenckind, mitt vyl guͦten und bösen <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>worten, allso das ettlich anfachen wancken.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de">Doch hofft man, <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>das mehr solle noch uff gottes seyten belyben.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="de">Ach es ist <lb xml:id="p2z28"/>doch zuͦ erbarmen, dsa wir alls gar ellend waichling seind <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>und der gloub so gantz schwach ist und wir unß by ainer <lb xml:id="p2z30"/>so guͦten sach, da uns kain verlierinds uff staht, als ubel <lb xml:id="p2z31"/>forchten und nitt unser leben und sterben frey auff den <lb xml:id="p2z32"/>setzend, der allein ewig lebend machen oder tödten kan<lb xml:id="p2z33"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="signature">[Unterschrift fehlt.]</note>
					<note type="address">[Adresse vor 279:]</note>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>An maister <persName ref="p495">Hainrich <lb xml:id="p3z2"/>Bullinger</persName> zuͦ <placeName ref="l587">Zuͤrich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
